"in proportion to the expenses incurred. As a result, subsidies receivable "
"may be recorded when the grant agreement is signed and eligible expenses "
"have been incurred, even if the funds have not yet been received."
msgstr ""
"Perusahaan telah menerima subsidi yang diakui dalam pendapatan operasional "
"sebanding dengan biaya yang dikeluarkan. Oleh karena itu, piutang subsidi "
"dapat dicatat saat perjanjian hibah ditandatangani dan biaya yang memenuhi "
"syarat telah dikeluarkan, meskipun dana belum diterima."

